{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>I will make My arrows drunk with blood, and My sword shall devour flesh.</b> As it says: כִּי בָאֵשׁ י׳ נִשְׁפָּט וּבְחַרְבּוֹ אֶת כָּל בָּשָׂר (Isaiah 66:16)." "<b>From the blood of the slain and the captives.</b> As it says: וְרַבּוּ חַלְלֵי י׳ (Isaiah 66:24)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {1 "The citation reads ישעיהו כב:ב, but the quoted phrase וְרַבּוּ חַלְלֵי ה׳ does not appear at Isaiah 22:2; it matches Isaiah 66:24. The chapter reference appears to be a typographical error for סו (66)."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:26.227451426Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}